DOTFILES_ROOT_PATH: (Optional) Repository root containing dotfiles.toml. (default: current workflow repository)
WITS_SOURCE_DIR: (Optional) Path to the Wits source directory. (default: <repository>/wits)
--hostname / SETUP_HOSTNAME: System hostname and the Dotdrop host declared in
    hosts.toml. Matched case-insensitively; if it is not a declared host, the
    unique machine whose overlays include --profile is used.
--profile / SETUP_PROFILE: Overlay and transcrypt context (default: personal).
WITS_TRANSCRYPT_<OVERLAY>_<KEY>: Credentials for that overlay's transcrypt
    context. generate compiles every host, so every overlay any machine uses
    must be decryptable. e.g.
    + WITS_TRANSCRYPT_PERSONAL_PASSWORD
    + WITS_TRANSCRYPT_PERSONAL_CIPHER
    + WITS_TRANSCRYPT_PERSONAL_DIGEST
    + WITS_TRANSCRYPT_PERSONAL_KDF
    + WITS_TRANSCRYPT_PERSONAL_ITERATIONS
Legacy TRANSCRYPT_<OVERLAY>_<KEY> is copied onto the WITS_ form when the
    latter is unset.
